					"content": "这些就应该足够了，我们去找<color=#00E1FFFF>吉丽安娜修女</color>吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2006004,
